s10-4-p2 = prose (cons "Section 1 introduced observation fibers for histories and established what a dependent rationale over a fiber means. Here the same construction is applied to *available actions* in a running system: a participant must establish a property for every state compatible with what it has actually observed. For a state type \(S\), an observation is a function \(o:S\to O\), which may itself be computed by an interacting process. The fiber" nil)
